{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"部分\",\n      \"sec\": \"S02（对照S04）\",\n      \"why\": \"S02写出持续撑持让他察觉费力、郑重会消耗人，却没有完整写出努力本身如何反过来揭示眷恋的深度；S04确认在意的原因则是暂时离开注意力后它仍然回来，因果机制有所不同。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"反复确认不能把刚才的安静带回来，而害怕失去已经体验过的亲近又让“还在不在”的问题持续占满他，写出了追问无效与不舍催生追问之间的因果循环。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"熟悉的无着落感突然返场时身体先收紧，而刚重新触到的亲近使这次惊动反过来显出他缺乏安全感、害怕失去的正是那份亲近。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S10–S11\",\n      \"why\": \"S10写出受惊和疲惫的身体试图压住期待却无法消除牵挂，S11进一步写出反复冲撞耗尽犹疑后，残留的期待转成向前的推动力，基本形成了疲惫削弱抵抗、牵挂接管行动的完整因果链。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"invented\": [\n    \"S05把“另一个人是否也同样在意”设为核心问题，预设了一个具体的关系对象及对方可能回应的关系情境，但音乐本身不能证实对方的存在或其情感立场。\",\n    \"S06把内在的亲近感写成“那个人像真的就在身边、两个人此刻很近”的共同在场场景，将音乐中的情绪转化成了缺乏外部依据的具体情境。\",\n    \"S07–S09把这段亲近写成确曾发生、随后被打断或濒临失去、又短暂重现的关系往事，构成了一条听感无法证实的事件链。\"\n  ],\n  \"loops\": [\n    \"S10先试图压低期待，压不住后又向前确认，随即因认出熟悉的紧绷感而再次收住，形成“收缩—探出—再收缩”的机械策略循环。\",\n    \"S11先冲出去却未能安定，再更急地冲，随后反复尝试重新站稳仍告失败，最后将这一连串失败收束为只剩单一向前冲力的应对循环。\"\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a942b3c3-9300-47e9-8604-e454615426e6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T130653637164Z", "elapsed_seconds": 382.344, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:13:15.989721+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "721bcc77eae4708ea50f7fc59a5a69a264738f5a6f15e908c5609f8c10469ff7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T130653637164Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8d8d0de2e5f7530eb716dc31c23a8d0e9842c36a8f44b2c34b633c87585bf44c"}}}
